## 2. Walkthrough & Exam Drills

### Drill 1: DaemonSet Deployment (`01-daemonsets/`)

1. **Deploy Cluster-Wide DaemonSet**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_workloads_advanced_dir }}/01-daemonsets/cka-lab-log-collector-ds.yaml
   kubectl rollout status daemonset/cka-lab-log-collector-ds
   kubectl get pods -l app=cka-lab-log-collector -o wide
   ```

### Drill 2: Batch Processing & CronJobs (`02-batch-jobs/`)

1. **Deploy Parallel Batch Job**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_workloads_advanced_dir }}/02-batch-jobs/cka-lab-parallel-job.yaml
   kubectl wait --for=condition=complete job/cka-lab-parallel-job --timeout=60s
   kubectl get jobs,pods -l app=cka-lab-parallel-task
   ```

1. **Deploy Scheduled CronJob**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_workloads_advanced_dir }}/02-batch-jobs/cka-lab-cronjob.yaml
   kubectl get cronjobs
   ```

### Drill 3: Multi-Container & Native Sidecars (`03-multi-container/`)

1. **Deploy Init Container Pod**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_workloads_advanced_dir }}/03-multi-container/cka-lab-init-container-pod.yaml
   kubectl wait --for=condition=Ready pod/cka-lab-init-pod --timeout=60s
   kubectl logs cka-lab-init-pod -c main-app
   ```

1. **Deploy Native Sidecar Container**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_workloads_advanced_dir }}/03-multi-container/cka-lab-native-sidecar-pod.yaml
   kubectl wait --for=condition=Ready pod/cka-lab-native-sidecar-pod --timeout=60s
   kubectl logs cka-lab-native-sidecar-pod -c telemetry-sidecar
   ```

